    "Strict exactfields;schema/profile/scenario versions exactinteger1. Profile/catalog/source hashes pinned. Opaque ASCII IDs1..64. Onlyscenario.kind=educational_editorial_weights andexhaustive=true;bounded nonemptydescription<=4000characters.",
    "Nodes1..256;queries0..256;maxdepth32edges. Eachnode hasuniqueID,exactlyone parentID ornull;exactlyone root,parentnull andweight1. Everyotherparentexists;no selfparent,cycles,disconnected components ormultiple roots. Treevalidation independent ofzero probability; unreachable structuralnodes reject.",
    "All weights/utilities rational STRINGS matching -?(0|nonzero upto9digits)(/positive upto9digits)?; no numeric/bool/float,exponents,decimalpoints,nonfiniteorwhitespace. ParseexactFraction;weightin[0,1],utilityabsolute<=1000000. Guard eachcalculated reduced numerator/denominator<=8192bits. Never silently normalize orround.",
    "Everyinternalnode hasutilitynull anditschildweights sumexactly1,includingzero-massparentbranches. Everyleaf hasexplicitdeclared rationalutility,includingzero-weightleaves. Rootmaybesingleleaf withweight1 andutility. No implicit residual/missingoutcome utility.",
    "Rootmass1;allpathmasses exactproducts. Preservezeroweightnodes/leaves;complete modeledleafmass mustequal1. Completeness is a declared finite model; external omitted possibilities withrenormalized weights cannotbe detected.",
    "ComputeEUbottom-up via conditionalchildweights. Every nodeevent is set ofdescendantterminalleaves. Queries haveuniqueID,existinggivenandtargetIDs. IfP(given)=0,probability=null andstatus=not_estimable_zero_condition;neverconditionaldivisionbyzero. Otherwise use nested/disjoint subtreeintersection mass divided bygivenmass. Node conditionalexpectedutility isnull forzero-massnodes,not an empiricalutility estimate.",
    "Canonicalize nodes andqueries byID beforeevaluation,request/model/input/report identities;inputpermutations withsameidentities produceidenticalreports. Canonicalnodepaths retained andduplicate node/path definitions reject. Preserve scenario andquery identity/version andsource/code/snapshot/report hashes;no mutationofcallerinput.",
    "Preflight work=N*N+Q*N<=200000;returned_cells=16*N+8*Q<=20000. Validatebounded listsbeforequadraticwork. Fullfinite computation,nohidden truncation. CPU/memory complete-report measurements beforeclosure;targets5s/128MiB localobservationsonly.",
    "Provenance synthetic=true,rights=self_authored,source_ref infrozencatalog,nonemptyattribution/snapshot<=4000characters,exactUTF8snapshotSHA. No actualother-universe data orobserver/service integrations. Declarations andhashes do notcertify externaltruth.",
    "Independent fixtures frozen beforeproduction:literal1/2*1/3=1/6,6equiprobableatom enumeration andleaf-set conditionaloracle;64seven-node binarytrees withall49node-pair queries. Production forwardmass/backwardEU usesdifferenttraversalfromoracleleaf-parentwalk/leafsets.",
    "Arbitraryeditorial scenario probabilities are distinctfrom Bornrule squaredamplitudes. No quantum-state/amplitude dynamics,decoherence,multiverseobservations,Everettproof,alternate-timeline forecast orsupernaturalprobability. Optional narrative is boundeddescription andnever affects math."
